    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's not just about the injury though. It's like... the version of me that actually mattered, the one who had purpose and drive, is just gone. There's nothing left to rebuild. It feels like I'm just waiting for the rest of me to catch up to the fact that the story is already finished. Does that even make sense? Like, why keep going through the motions when the main character is already dead?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
